title: "Cross-Corpus Bengali Sarcasm Detection"
abstract: >-
  Code and results for a cross-corpus evaluation of Bengali sarcasm detection across three
  human-annotated corpora, including multi-source training, domain-adversarial baselines, and
  target label-efficiency analysis.
